{
  "label": "Advanced Search",
  "category": "Alert Issuer",
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "Advanced Search & Filter",
      "id": "advanced-search",
      "intro": "Panel Search Filter di Alert Issuer memungkinkan pencarian alert berdasarkan Alert ID, UTRNNO, Status klasifikasi, rentang tanggal, dan Sort Direction. Panel muncul dari sisi kanan layar dengan lebar 320px.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Membuka Panel Search Filter",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Klik tombol **Filter** (ikon funnel/search) di toolbar atas\n• Panel **Search Filter** muncul dari sisi kanan\n• Header: judul `Search Filter` + badge `Search` + tombol **X** untuk tutup\n• Subtitle `Set filters and apply` ditampilkan di bawah judul",
          "color": "#3b82f6",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:13px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 2px 16px rgba(59,130,246,.12);border:1px solid #bfdbfe;\"><div style=\"background:#fff;padding:14px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;\"><div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin-bottom:3px;\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Search Filter</span><span style=\"padding:2px 8px;border-radius:20px;background:#dbeafe;border:1px solid #93c5fd;font-size:8.5px;font-weight:700;color:#2563eb;\">● Search</span></div><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#94a3b8;\">Set filters and apply</div></div><button style=\"padding:4px;border-radius:6px;background:#f1f5f9;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;cursor:pointer;color:#64748b;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M18 6L6 18M6 6l12 12\"/></svg></button></div><div style=\"background:#f8fafc;padding:12px 16px;font-size:9.5px;color:#64748b;\">Panel width: 320px • Slide dari sisi kanan • Esc atau klik X untuk tutup</div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Filter Alert ID & UTRNNO",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• **Alert ID** — input numerik (`type=number`), nama field: `id`\n• **UTRNNO** — input numerik (`type=number`), nama field: `utrnno`\n• Keduanya opsional, bisa diisi salah satu atau keduanya\n• Gunakan untuk mencari alert spesifik berdasarkan ID atau Universal Transaction Reference Number",
          "color": "#f59e0b",
          "bg": "#fffbeb",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:13px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(245,158,11,.1);border:1px solid #fde68a;\"><div style=\"background:#fff;padding:14px 16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;\"><div><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;margin-bottom:4px;\">Alert ID</div><div style=\"padding:7px 10px;border-radius:7px;background:#f8fafc;border:1.5px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:10px;color:#94a3b8;\">Enter alert ID</div></div><div><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;margin-bottom:4px;\">UTRNNO</div><div style=\"padding:7px 10px;border-radius:7px;background:#f8fafc;border:1.5px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:10px;color:#94a3b8;\">Enter utrnno</div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 3,
          "title": "Filter Status Klasifikasi",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Dropdown **Status** — field: `isClassified`\n• Pilihan status: `Classified` atau `Not Classified` (dari `DummyClasifyStatus`)\n• Clearable: bisa di-reset ke kosong\n• Berguna untuk fokus ke alert yang belum atau sudah diklasifikasi",
          "color": "#6366f1",
          "bg": "#eef2ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:13px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(99,102,241,.1);border:1px solid #c7d2fe;\"><div style=\"background:#fff;padding:14px 16px;\"><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;margin-bottom:6px;\">Status</div><div style=\"padding:7px 10px;border-radius:7px;background:#f8fafc;border:1.5px solid #c7d2fe;font-size:10px;color:#4f46e5;font-weight:600;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;\"><span>Choose status</span><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\"/></svg></div><div style=\"margin-top:6px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:7px 12px;font-size:10px;color:#0f172a;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;cursor:pointer;background:#eff6ff;\">Classified</div><div style=\"padding:7px 12px;font-size:10px;color:#0f172a;cursor:pointer;\">Not Classified</div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 4,
          "title": "Filter Date From & Date To",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• **Date From** — `DateTimePicker` dengan seconds, field: `dateFrom`\n• **Date To** — `DateTimePicker` dengan seconds, field: `dateTo`\n• Format tampilan: `DD/MM/YYYY HH:mm:ss`\n• Gunakan date picker untuk memilih rentang waktu alert yang ingin dicari",
          "color": "#8b5cf6",
          "bg": "#f5f3ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:13px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(139,92,246,.1);border:1px solid #ddd6fe;\"><div style=\"background:#fff;padding:14px 16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;\"><div><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;margin-bottom:4px;\">Date From</div><div style=\"padding:7px 10px;border-radius:7px;background:#f8fafc;border:1.5px solid #ddd6fe;font-size:10px;color:#94a3b8;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"4\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\"/><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"6\"/><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"6\"/><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"10\"/></svg>Pick a date</div></div><div><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;margin-bottom:4px;\">Date To</div><div style=\"padding:7px 10px;border-radius:7px;background:#f8fafc;border:1.5px solid #ddd6fe;font-size:10px;color:#94a3b8;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"4\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\"/><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"6\"/><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"6\"/><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"10\"/></svg>Pick a date</div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 5,
          "title": "Sort Direction & Apply/Reset",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• **Sort Direction** — dropdown dengan pilihan:\n  - `ASC` → Ascending (Oldest First)\n  - `DESC` → Descending (Newest First) *(default)*\n• Tombol **Reset** — clear semua filter & reload data sesuai tab aktif\n• Tombol **Apply Filters** — submit form & reload tabel dengan filter baru\n• Loading spinner muncul di tombol Apply saat proses fetch",
          "color": "#14b8a6",
          "bg": "#f0fdfa",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:13px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(20,184,166,.1);border:1px solid #99f6e4;\"><div style=\"background:#fff;padding:14px 16px;\"><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;margin-bottom:6px;\">Sort Direction</div><div style=\"padding:7px 10px;border-radius:7px;background:#f0fdfa;border:1.5px solid #5eead4;font-size:10px;color:#0d9488;font-weight:600;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:14px;\"><span>Descending (Newest First)</span><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\"/></svg></div><div style=\"height:1px;background:#f1f5f9;margin-bottom:12px;\"></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;\"><button style=\"flex:1;padding:8px;border-radius:8px;background:#f1f5f9;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#475569;cursor:pointer;\">Reset</button><button style=\"flex:1;padding:8px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#14b8a6,#0d9488);border:none;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;cursor:pointer;\">Apply Filters</button></div></div></div>"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
